# 统一以 LF 存储并以 LF 检出：避免 Windows 上 CRLF 漂移、避免
# "LF would be replaced by CRLF" 类噪音（本机 core.eol=crlf 且无仓库级属性）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确文本类型，防止被自动探测成二进制
*.md     text
*.js     text
*.mjs    text
*.json   text
*.yml    text
*.yaml   text
*.svg    text

# 资源文件保持原样
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.webp   binary
